        "date": "2026-11-19T00:14:10Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(fidelity)!: keep hole words for v0.21-v0.24 stock copies and mark format break\n\nHeal marked FromModel stock copies without their own mesh_open from\ntheir live source model in adopt_copies, and fall back to the source's\nhole once in coarse_source when an unhealed copy has none. Update\ndocs/decisions/1700-stock-copy-hole.md to state that #1610 shipped in\nv0.21.0 through v0.24.0 and to record why PROJECT_VERSION stays at the\nbranch base.\n\nPinned by\na_v021_to_v024_copy_without_its_own_hole_keeps_naming_its_sources_hole\nin crates/app/tests/stock_copy_hole.rs.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Project files with a mesh_open key on a FromModel stock\ncopy are refused as corrupt by v0.21.0 to v0.24.0 readers.\n\nRefs #1700",
